## 8. Real-runtime note

This branch is parent-side/bus-only. It does not touch worker, lifecycle, scheduler, request settlement, stream shaping, native backend execution, prompt semantics, or cancellation behavior.

Real-runtime testing is therefore not required for the direct replay contract if the branch remains within this scope. Michael may still run spot execute-action real-runtime regression checks after upload if desired.

